  "ruleText": "Saf-C 502.07 Legal address” means specification of the location where a person makes their residence. The term does not include addresses consisting solely of a post office box number.\n\nSource. #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
